    <div class="measure">
      <h2>In an array</h2>
      <p>This is where close spacing pays off. Fig. 3A shows five elements in a circle on a 6.44 in radius metal substrate, with 3.175 in between adjacent elements, the kind of tight layout a CRPA needs.</p>
    </div>

